      "content": "The idea of accepting the void and ceasing the struggle is a deeply compelling thought when exhaustion is so intense. However, for many, \"the fight\" is not about achieving a perfect end result, but about the process of self-expression and engagement with life. This desire to keep going can be a fundamental, biological drive towards experience, even if that experience is fragile. If the friction is too great, please consider reaching out to a support line to talk through this immense weight you are feeling right now.",
